ecialed/transition/communitypartner\" id=\"\" rel=\"\" target=\"\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"Community Partner\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"423227a9-3694-4ee5-b37a-a4894bd0c764\" height=\"163\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Community%201.PNG\" width=\"120\"> </a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a aria-label=\"\" data-entity-substitution=\"\" data-entity-type=\"\" data-entity-uuid=\"\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/specialed/transition/employer\" id=\"\" rel=\"\" target=\"\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"Employer\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"74d43f23-b191-4af9-851e-3240daa82f79\" height=\"163\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Employer%20Button.PNG\" width=\"120\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-align-center\">Have you thought about your plans for the future?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a aria-label=\"\" data-entity-substitution=\"\" data-entity-type=\"\" data-entity-uuid=\"\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/specialed/transition/youngperson/continue\" id=\"\" rel=\"\" target=\"\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"I want to continue my education.\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"cf772ffb-ce4d-4ecf-920d-c0f35e3a7328\" height=\"240\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Continue%20Education%201.PNG\" width=\"188\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a aria-label=\"\" data-entity-substitution=\"\" data-entity-type=\"\" data-entity-uuid=\"\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/specialed/transition/youngperson/career\" id=\"\" rel=\"\" target=\"\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"I want to explore career opportunities.\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"783ed13e-2fd2-4254-b6b3-f45015ef78f1\" height=\"240\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Explore%20Careers%201.PNG\" width=\"188\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a aria-label=\"\" data-entity-substitution=\"\" data-entity-type=\"\" data-entity-uuid=\"\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/specialed/transition/youngperson/idontknow\" id=\"\" rel=\"\" target=\"\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"I don't know yet.\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"d980c9b6-afae-4223-9009-2659ba2d4841\" height=\"240\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/I%20dont%20Know%20Yet%201.png\" width=\"188\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-align-center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"text-align-center\"><strong>What is Transitioning to Adulthood All About?</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-align-center\">Transition is when you are planning for the changes that come with navigating life after high-school and into adulthood!</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-align-center\"><iframe align=\"center\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BgOKUemzK8E\" title=\"YouTube video player\" width=\"560\" style=\"height:315px;\"></iframe></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3>CONTACT:</h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-10\">\r\n<p><strong>Titus O'Rourke</strong><br>\r\nTransition Specialist<br>\r\n<a href=\"mailto:titus.orourke@maine.gov\">titus.orourke@maine.gov</a><br>\r\n207-215-6303&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-eyebrow\">Transition</p>\n<p class=\"doe-contact-link\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n\n</div>\n<a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/specialed/transition\"></a>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a aria-label=\"\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/specialed/transition/youngperson\" id=\"\" rel=\"\" target=\"\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"Young Person\" height=\"217\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Young%20Person_0.PNG\" width=\"160\"> </a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a aria-label=\"\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/specialed/transition/caregiver\" id=\"\" rel=\"\" target=\"\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"Caregiver\" height=\"163\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Caregiver.PNG\" width=\"120\"> </a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a aria-label=\"\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/specialed/transition/educator\" id=\"\" rel=\"\" target=\"\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"Educator\" height=\"163\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Educator%201.PNG\" width=\"120\"> </a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a aria-label=\"\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/specialed/transition/communitypartner\" id=\"\" rel=\"\" target=\"\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"Community Partner\" height=\"163\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Community%201.PNG\" width=\"120\"> </a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a aria-label=\"\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/specialed/transition/employer\" id=\"\" rel=\"\" target=\"\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"Employer\" height=\"163\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Employer%20Button.PNG\" width=\"120\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"have-you-thought-about-your-plans-for-the-future\"><h2>Have you thought about your plans for the future?</h2></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a aria-label=\"\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/specialed/transition/youngperson/continue\" id=\"\" rel=\"\" target=\"\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"I want to continue my education.\" height=\"240\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Continue%20Education%201.PNG\" width=\"188\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a aria-label=\"\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/specialed/transition/youngperson/career\" id=\"\" rel=\"\" target=\"\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"I want to explore career opportunities.\" height=\"240\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Explore%20Careers%201.PNG\" width=\"188\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a aria-label=\"\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/specialed/transition/youngperson/idontknow\" id=\"\" rel=\"\" target=\"\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"I don't know yet.\" height=\"240\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/I%20dont%20Know%20Yet%201.png\" width=\"188\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"doe-sub\"><h3 class=\"text-align-center\">What is Transitioning to Adulthood All About?</h3></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-align-center\">Transition is when you are planning for the changes that come with navigating life after high-school and into adulthood!</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"doe-video\"><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BgOKUemzK8E\" title=\"YouTube video player\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"contact\" class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3>CONTACT:</h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-10\">\r\n<p><strong>Titus O'Rourke</strong><br>\r\n<em>Transition Specialist</em><br>\r\n<a href=\"mailto:titus.orourke@maine.gov\">Titus.Orourke@maine.gov</a><br>\r\n207-215-6303&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-jump\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":["1 section header — too few for a contents list.","Heading levels skip: jumps h1 to h3. Needs a person."],"decisions":[{"id":"outline","on":true,"label":"Rebuild the heading outline","why":"2 headings sit at a level the page never opens — \"Have you thought about your plans for the future\" is an h3 with no h2 above it, so it is neither announced nor styled as the sub-section it is. Each heading moves to one level below whatever encloses it.","value":"h3 → h2"},{"id":"blockhead","on":true,"label":"Turn the headings into section headers","why":"1 heading is plain text where every other page uses a section header, so the page reads as one continuous wall instead of parts.","value":"1 section"},{"id":"emailcase","on":true,"label":"Write the email addresses the same way","why":"1 address is shown in whatever case it was typed in. The house form capitalises each name and leaves a middle initial in lower case — titus.orourke@maine.gov → Titus.Orourke@maine.gov. Only the first letter of each part changes, so a name that spells itself LaBreck keeps doing so.","value":"1 address"},{"id":"subheads","on":true,"label":"Give the sub-headings their rule","why":"1 sub-heading is plain bold text. The design has a treatment for them — a teal rule down the left and a line across — and it had never been used on any page, because it needs a wrapper an author would have to know about.","value":"1 heading"},{"id":"contacttitle","on":true,"label":"Set a job title the way the rest of the site does","why":"1 job title sits in plain text under the person's name, where 186 elsewhere on the site are in italics — so the same contact block is drawn two ways depending on the page, and the title runs into the name above it. The standard here is the site's own, not a preference: two thirds of these blocks already do it. No word changes.","value":"1 title"},{"id":"leftalign","on":true,"label":"Left-align a section header","why":"1 section header is centred, where 1,103 of the 1,139 on the site are left-aligned — the component list says not to centre them. The band runs the full width of the column, so a centred title has no fixed relationship to anything else, and a two-line one breaks the left edge every other heading shares. Only the alignment changes.","value":"1 header"},{"id":"banner-graphic","on":true,"label":"Retire the old banner graphic","why":"It repeats the page title in picture form, which the new banner already does in type.","removes":"Banner 1 Primary.png"},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"Transition\"","why":"Taken from the parent page, /learning/specialed/transition."}],"mechanic